      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "You should absolutely not start taking St. John's Wort while on warfarin without first consulting your doctor. This combination is known to interact dangerously, potentially making your blood-thinning medication less effective or causing unpredictable bleeding issues. For mood changes, it is crucial to discuss safe, evidence-based options with the healthcare provider who manages your heart rhythm.",
