      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "Separating the timing of your medications will not eliminate the serious pharmacokinetic interaction between St. John's Wort and warfarin. The herb can still interfere with your liver's ability to process the warfarin, regardless of when you take them. For immediate, safe guidance on managing your mood while on anticoagulants, consider using a dedicated telehealth service or calling your pharmacist directly for an urgent review.",
      "source": "target",
